    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "您好！我因为感冒发烧，明天要去医院看医生，不能到学校上课。",
      "traditional": "您好！我因為感冒發燒，明天要去醫院看醫生，不能到學校上課。",
      "pinyin": "nín hǎo wǒ yīn wèi gǎn mào fā shāo míng tiān yào qù yī yuàn kàn yī shēng bù néng dào xué xiào shàng kè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "我想请一天病假，请批准。",
      "traditional": "我想請一天病假，請批准。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ xiǎng qǐng yì tiān bìng jià qǐng pī zhǔn",
      "english": "Hello! I’ve caught a cold and have a fever. I need to go to the doctor and can’t come to school tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I would like to know if I could take sick leave for one day."
    },
    {
